{"id":"trasero","lemma":"trasero","pos":"adj","rank":765,"glosses":["back, back-side, rear end, posterior"],"ipa":"/tɾaˈseɾo/","forms":{"feminine":"trasera","masculinePlural":"traseros","femininePlural":"traseras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-trasero.wav","examples":[{"text":"Hay un árbol en mi patio trasero.","en":"There is a tree in my backyard.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705190","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"tree"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"yard, patio"},null]},{"text":"Tenemos tres árboles en nuestro patio trasero.","en":"We have three trees in our backyard.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582445","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"tree","l":"árbol"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"our, ours, to us"},{"g":"yard, patio"},null]},{"text":"El chico entró por la puerta trasera.","en":"The boy entered by the back door.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"boy"},{"g":"to enter","l":"entrar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"},null]},{"text":"¡Te patearé el trasero!","en":"I'll kick your butt!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734312","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to kick","l":"patear"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Muchas personas se hicieron paso hacia la salida trasera.","en":"Many people pushed their way toward the rear exit.","words":[{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"step, footstep"},{"g":"toward, towards"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"exit, way out"},null]}]}